                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Should Indian brands do CNY campaigns?</h3>
                                        <p>For Southeast Asia expansion (Singapore + Malaysia) or Dubai / Chinese tourist audiences: yes. For pure India focus: less relevant.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does CNY drive for Singapore D2C brands?</h3>
                                        <p>20-40% of annual revenue for many D2C categories. Beauty + fashion + F&B peak higher.</p>
                                        <h3>Is Dubai worth targeting for Chinese tourists?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes during CNY period — Chinese tourists spend disproportionately in Dubai on luxury + fragrance + duty-free.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest CNY cultural mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Ignoring red / gold + auspicious traditions or including inauspicious elements (white, number 4, funeral associations). Cultural sensitivity essential.</p>
